&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/nab138/iloader/actions/workflows/build.yml&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/nab138/iloader/build.yml?style=flat&amp;amp;logo=github&amp;amp;logoColor=white&amp;amp;label=Build%20iloader&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Build iloader&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgist.githubusercontent.com%2Fnab138%2F28258aff7e3f1d3a3084a21f4cff2e57%2Fraw%2Filoader_downloads.json&amp;amp;style=flat&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Downloads&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Install SideStore (or other apps) and import your pairing file with ease&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This repository and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://iloader.app&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;iloader.app&lt;/a&gt; are the only official ways to download iloader. There is also an unofficial &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://formulae.brew.sh/cask/iloader&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Homebrew cask&lt;/a&gt;, an unofficial &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/iloader-bin&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;AUR package&lt;/a&gt;, and an unofficial &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://copr.fedorainfracloud.org/coprs/anudeepd/iloader&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Fedora COPR repository&lt;/a&gt; maintained by the community. Do not download from any other sources or websites.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;img width=&#34;1918&#34; height=&#34;998&#34; alt=&#34;iloader0&#34; src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/93cd135d-6d89-46ee-9b9f-12c596806911&#34; /&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;how-to-use&#34;&gt;How to use
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install usbmuxd for your platform
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://apple.co/ms&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;iTunes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;macOS: Included&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux: Potentially included, if not, install via your package manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install the latest version for your platform from the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/nab138/iloader/releases&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;releases&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NixOS: Use the flake &lt;code&gt;github:nab138/iloader&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plug in your iDevice to your computer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open the app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sign into your Apple ID&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Select your action (e.g. install SideStore)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;features&#34;&gt;Features
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install SideStore (or LiveContainer + SideStore), import certificate and place rppairing+lockdown pairing files automatically&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Import any IPA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intelligent error suggestions to help resolve common issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage pairing files in apps like StikDebug, SideStore, Protokolle, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;See and revoke development certificates &amp;amp; app ids&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;troubleshooting&#34;&gt;Troubleshooting
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you are unable to solve an issue on your own, copy the full error message and ask on the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.gg/EA6yVgydBz&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;idevice Discord server&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/nab138/iloader/issues&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;open an issue&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can view app logs with the &amp;ldquo;View Logs.&amp;rdquo; If nothing is showing up, change the log level to &amp;ldquo;Debug.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If those logs aren&amp;rsquo;t helpful, logs with additional are stored in the following locations:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows: &lt;code&gt;%APPDATA%\me.nabdev.iloader\logs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;macOS: &lt;code&gt;~/Library/Application Support/me.nabdev.iloader/logs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux: &lt;code&gt;~/.local/share/me.nabdev.iloader/logs/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;translating&#34;&gt;Translating
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;iloader needs localization! If you speak another language and notice iloader does not support it or has mistakes, please consider contributing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To update/edit an existing language, make a PR modifying &lt;code&gt;src/locales/&amp;lt;lang&amp;gt;.json&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To add a new language, add your language to &lt;code&gt;src/i18next.ts&lt;/code&gt;, and in &lt;code&gt;src/locales&lt;/code&gt; copy &lt;code&gt;en.json&lt;/code&gt; to a new file titled &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;langcode&amp;gt;.json&lt;/code&gt; and update the strings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;i18next.ts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-ts&#34; data-lang=&#34;ts&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kr&#34;&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;languages&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;en&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;English&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;],&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;es&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Español&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;],&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;// Your language here...
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;]&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;kr&#34;&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;kr&#34;&gt;const&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can also add your name to the translators section of the README.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thank you for translating!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;building-from-source&#34;&gt;Building from source
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://bun.sh&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;bun&lt;/a&gt; (or &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://nodejs.org&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Node.js&lt;/a&gt;) and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Rust&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clone the repository and &lt;code&gt;cd&lt;/code&gt; into it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run &lt;code&gt;bun i&lt;/code&gt; (or &lt;code&gt;npm i&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For development with hot reload: &lt;code&gt;bun tauri dev&lt;/code&gt; (or &lt;code&gt;npm run tauri dev&lt;/code&gt;)
Make a production build: &lt;code&gt;bun tauri build&lt;/code&gt; (or &lt;code&gt;npm run tauri build&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;credits&#34;&gt;Credits
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Icon made by &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/transistor-exe&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Transistor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UI improved by &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/StephenDev0&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;StephenDev0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/jkcoxson/idevice&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;idevice&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/jkcoxson&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;jkcoxson&lt;/a&gt; for communicating with iOS devices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/nab138/isideload&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;isideload&lt;/a&gt; for installing apps
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/jkcoxson/idevice&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;idevice&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/jkcoxson&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;jkcoxson&lt;/a&gt; crate is used to communicate with the device&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/Dadoum/apple-codesign-quick&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;apple-codesign-quick&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/Dadoum&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Dadoum&lt;/a&gt; for codesigning and entitlements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/claration/Impactor&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Impactor&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/claration&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;claration&lt;/a&gt; was used as a reference for cryptography operations (converting certs to p12, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/Dadoum/Sideloader&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
